# Implementation Plan: Multi-Broker SSH Health Monitoring & Desktop Notifications

Implement background SSH heartbeat health monitoring across all discovered cluster brokers and native Windows/macOS desktop notifications when any broker connection drops or encounters issues.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Application Class Update (`QApplication`)**:
> To support cross-platform native desktop notifications and system tray integration (`QSystemTrayIcon`), `app/main.py` will use `QApplication` from `PySide6.QtWidgets` instead of `QGuiApplication`. This enables native Windows 10/11 toast notifications and macOS Notification Center alerts without third-party dependencies.

> [!NOTE]
> **Multi-Broker SSH Auth Strategy**:
> Discovered brokers (from `rpk cluster info`) will be monitored using the active cluster profile's SSH credentials (SSH user + password/key). If a cluster uses distinct credentials per host, we will allow overriding per-broker host IPs in the profile.

